CBNewPass args;obj;event;ctl;parent;i;nyt2;nyt1;pwd;error;p
⍝ Change Password

(obj event)←2↑args
parent←⍎(-p←(⌽obj)⍳'.')↓obj ⍝ This will be the "Diverse" Tab

:If (,'C')≡ctl←(1-p)↑obj ⍝ One of the LabelBefore controls
    parent←parent.##.##
:EndIf

(pwd nyt1 nyt2)←parent.(ROW1.PWD ROW2.NYT1 ROW2.NYT2).C.Text

:Select event
:Case 'KeyPress'
    →0 ⊣ eNQ (1001@2)args ⍝ Enqueue after the event
:Case 1001
    →0 ⊣ parent.CHANGE.Active←((nyt1≡nyt2)∧6≤≢nyt1)  ⍝ Activate button if passwords are identical and length is at least 6
:EndSelect

:If 'CHANGE'≡ctl
    :If nyt1≢nyt2   ⍝ PARANOIA: This should not be possible - button should be inactive
        →0 ⊣ DisplayPopup 'Skift passord' 'De to passord er ikke ens' 'Error' 'OK'
    :ElseIf 6>≢nyt1 ⍝ More paranoia
        →0 ⊣ DisplayPopup 'Skift passord' 'Det nye passord må ha mindst 6 tegn' 'Error' 'OK'
    :EndIf

    :Hold 'USERS.UserId'
        i←USERS.UserId⍳⊂USERID
        →(0≠≢error←ValidatePassword i pwd)⍴ERROR ⍝ Check user knows the current password
        SetPassword i nyt1
        DisplayPopup 'OWUM' 'Passord er skiftet' 'Info' 'OK'
    :EndHold
:EndIf

→0

ERROR:
 DisplayPopup 'OWUM' error 'Error' 'OK'
